.TH "DEDB DOWNLOAD" "1" "2026-01-01" "0.0.15" "dedb download Manual"
.SH NAME
dedb\-download \- Download and extract one or more games.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dedb download
[OPTIONS] GAMES...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download and extract one or more games.
.PP
Each GAME needs a scheme (gog:<id>, archive:<id>, or an archive.org
URL), or -b <scheme> with a bare id. A bare name works only for a
game already downloaded.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-b,\fP \-\-backend SCHEME
Read GAME as a bare id for this backend, rather than a <scheme>://<id> URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-redownload\fP
Re-download and re-extract even if already present.
.TP
\fB\-r,\fP \-\-refreshmetadata
Re-fetch cached backend metadata instead of using the cached copy.
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\fP
Keep the installer/archive after extracting.
